<!-- 手机版行程单:只展示 web 生成的 itinerary_sheet 图 + 客户保存图片。客户不二次转发,绝不端上自渲染。 -->
<view class="mi-page">
  <view wx:if="{{isOperatorPreview}}" class="mi-preview-banner">运营预览 · 客户看到的手机版行程单</view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="mi-state">
    <view class="mi-state-text">手机版行程单加载中…</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="mi-state">
    <view class="mi-state-title">暂时无法打开</view>
    <view class="mi-state-text">{{error}}</view>
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{sheetUrl}}">
    <scroll-view scroll-y="{{true}}" class="mi-scroll">
      <image
        class="mi-sheet"
        src="{{sheetUrl}}"
        mode="widthFix"
        show-menu-by-longpress="{{true}}"
        bindtap="onPreview"
      />
    </scroll-view>
    <!-- 客户端只读:只可保存图片,不开放二次转发(转发是运营动作,见 docs/product/itinerary-sheet-discipline.md R2) -->
    <view class="mi-actions">
      <button class="mi-btn primary" bindtap="onSave">保存图片到相册</button>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:else class="mi-state">
    <view class="mi-state-title">手机版行程单生成中</view>
    <view class="mi-state-text">网页端生成并同步后，这里会显示完整手机版行程单。</view>
  </view>
</view>
